<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Aug oil output falls to 87,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Aug oil output falls to 87,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>					Aug 96    July 96     June 96</p>
<p> crude oil	 (tonnes)     87,000     90,000	89,000</p>
<p> natural gas (million cu.meters)	52	   52	    63</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
